message: "If you use this project, please cite it as described below."
title: "Home Credit Default Risk Prediction with CatBoost"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Arain"
    given-names: "Sana Ur Rehman"
date-released: 2026-10-03
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end machine learning project for predicting loan payment
  difficulties using the Home Credit Default Risk dataset. The project
  includes exploratory data analysis, feature engineering, baseline models,
  CatBoost gradient boosting, validation-based early stopping, and probability
  blending evaluated with ROC-AUC.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - credit risk
  - default prediction
  - binary classification
  - CatBoost
  - feature engineering
  - ROC-AUC
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sanaurrehmanarain/home-credit-default-risk-catboost"
url: "https://github.com/Sanaurrehmanarain/home-credit-default-risk-catboost"